WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.127
What if a robot were told what to do by analogy,
not by an exact goal image?

00:00:05.207 --> 00:00:11.088
This ICML 2022 work from Berkeley and Meta
introduces goal-conditioned bisimulation: an

00:00:11.168 --> 00:00:16.706
abstraction where behaviorally equivalent
state-goal pairs share a representation,

00:00:16.786 --> 00:00:18.830
so goals compose by arithmetic.
